Package: veil
Version: __VERSION__
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: aofusa <aofusa@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), adduser | passwd
Homepage: https://github.com/aofusa/veil-proxy
Description: High-performance reverse proxy and web server
 Veil is a reverse proxy and web server for HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3
 with kTLS, io_uring, Proxy-Wasm filters, and seccomp / Landlock
 sandboxing. The package installs a default configuration that serves a
 page on http://127.0.0.1:8080/ and starts the veil service.
